e !\n\nRaphus is a long lost dodo whose DNA was recently found in an egg near the Dodo Care Center. It is not certain how the current dodos passed it from generations to generations, but it is important to hatch them and form this new dodo family again.\n\nRaphus is a fierce dodo : not fleeing when they see predators, they rather fight with all they have, which explain why they were extinct in the first place...\n\nUse your newly hatched Raphus on the Discord games here : https://discord.gg/tPy79krfrJ","img":"QmbxmjSNihNoX7PKMpy4euJnPRWwgTuETPDNApEeGh3uqh","start":1694887200000,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":1,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"cigalepixeld","templateId":745120},{"index":1,"kind":"ft","count":0,"amount":20,"symbol":"WAX","decimals":8,"contract":"eosio.token","quantity":"20.00000000 WAX","burn":false,"to":"b32ba.wam"}],"rolls":[{"total":1,"outcomes":[{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":745101}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":28460,"col":"cigalepixeld","cat":"Pixel Fighters","name":"Spring Armour","desc":"The **Spring Armour** is the first chestplate of Pixel Fighters, getting you better attributes for your everyday fighting or dungeon crawling.\n\n**Sets** are still not live on Pixel Fighters but will provide unique bonuses when completed. The **Spring Armour** is part of the **Tree Guardian** set that will provide an additional **damage resistance** against **Earth** damages, and a **damage bonus** for your **Earth** attacks.\n\n**How to blend ?**\n\n1. Get the blueprint on the **Drop** : https://neftyblocks.com/collection/cigalepixeld/drops/185949\n2. Get the materials in-game, on the Crafting Stone\n3. Blend here\n4. Profit !","img":"QmX1b2UjERNLtykHKdYqrBLJtFegjVzdiF1YWANeBssw7N","start":1687716000000,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":1,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"cigalepixeld","templateId":708632},{"index":1,"count":1,"burn":true,"to":nul